                "title": "Ellington Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Ellington Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a stylish, transitional door lock with clean lines and classic allure. This Single Cylinder Ellington Deadbolt will fit standard pre-drilled doors. It has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch backsets and 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The Yale Expressions Ellington Deadbolt is available in only the most popular finish colors.",
